# Project 5: On-Premises to AWS Cloud Connectivity via Site-to-Site VPN over Transit Gateway

A production-grade Site-to-Site VPN architecture connecting a simulated on-premises network to AWS cloud using IPSec/IKEv2, libreswan, Virtual Tunnel Interface (VTI), and AWS Transit Gateway. Traffic flows privately and encrypted between two completely isolated networks — proving enterprise-grade hybrid cloud connectivity.

**Region:** us-east-1  
**On-Prem VPC CIDR:** 192.168.0.0/16  
**AWS VPC CIDR:** 10.0.0.0/16  

---

