1. Terminate all 4 EC2 instances
2. Delete Site-to-Site VPN connection
3. Delete Customer Gateway
4. Delete TGW VPC attachment
5. Delete Transit Gateway
6. Delete route tables (disassociate subnets first)
7. Detach + delete both IGWs
8. Delete all subnets
9. Delete both VPCs
10. Delete key pair
